   "title": "Help",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 1 \u00b7 Plate + settings\n\nPaste the plate path into **i2 Roto \u00b7 Setup** (video file, frame folder, or `shot.####.exr`). Every setting lives on this node.\n\n- **window**: 1280x704 for 8 GB cards, 1920x1088 is the model's native size.\n- **detail**: `native` = sharp native-res edges (slowest), `proxy only` = one pass.\n- Check the info box and the first-frame preview before a long run."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## 1 \u00b7 Plate + settings\n\nPaste the plate path into **i2 Roto \u00b7 Setup** (video file, frame folder, or `shot.####.exr`). Every setting lives on this node.\n\n- **window**: 1280x704 for 8 GB cards, 1920x1088 is the model's native size.\n- **detail**: `native` = sharp native-res edges (slowest), `proxy only` = one pass.\n- Check the info box and the first-frame preview before a long run."
   }
