   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3 \u00b7 Proxy pass\n\nThe whole frame, scaled to fit the window, one chunk per loop iteration. Chunks share one frame; the last matte frame of a chunk is pinned as frame 0 of the next.\n\nMattes go to a cache on disk, not into RAM."
   ],
